#: ../../../user/templates/windows/qubes-windows-migrate.rst:3
#: d29dc6bb698449d1a3c46c8858340829
msgid "Migrate Windows qubes from old Qubes versions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/windows/qubes-windows-migrate.rst:6
#: 60f6d8bed5334a59bac8e4d6a92edf61
msgid ""
"For Windows 7, 10, and 11, there is a way to migrate backups created under "
"Qubes R4.1 to R4.2 and R4.3. For this, a backup must be created under R4.1, "
"and this backup has to be restored under Qubes R4.2 or R4.3, respectively, "
"resulting in a VM well integrated into this Qubes version. If ``qvm-features "
"<VMname> audio-model ich6`` is set, Windows will even have audio, although "
"for Windows 10 and 11, it is somewhat scratchy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/windows/qubes-windows-migrate.rst:10
#: 26b1477ebc52485cbfa5357a5f94d032
msgid "Preparation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/windows/qubes-windows-migrate.rst:13
#: 8245c4bcb9cc4e3d83be13b08463b57e
msgid ""
"While this is somewhat straightforward, things get difficult if QWT 4.1.68-1 "
"(or earlier) was installed in the VM. Prior to creating the backup, this old "
"version has to be removed, which can be quite tricky for Windows 10 and 11. "
"Otherwise, the restored backup will probably not start or run under Qubes "
"R4.2 or R4.3, because this QWT version is incompatible with these Qubes "
"versions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/windows/qubes-windows-migrate.rst:15
#: 5c8848e9dc0e4d17ba1d28bfafb59bb5
msgid ""
"To uninstall the installed QWT version, proceed as described in the :doc:"
"`QWT installation documentation </user/templates/windows/qubes-windows-"
"tools>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/windows/qubes-windows-migrate.rst:19
#: 64e0022a63ae4d45869c7edcbe7aeaf6
msgid "Transferring the Windows Qube"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/windows/qubes-windows-migrate.rst:22
#: ba056a01a4884696aedaab3037df93f0
msgid "Now, the backup for R4.2 or R4.3 may be created."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/windows/qubes-windows-migrate.rst:24
#: 973fa94449c8497aaf46379883e65eff
msgid ""
"This backup can be installed in Qubes R4.2 and R4.3 and will (probably) work."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/windows/qubes-windows-migrate.rst:26
#: cc4607a0be834836aea87b2c55943a21
msgid ""
"If Qubes Windows Tools was installed under R4.1, the new version for R4.2 or "
"R4.3 can then be installed as described in the documentation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/windows/qubes-windows-migrate.rst:29
#: 6c6176b2e1c749de9264516f09b367a9
msgid ""
"**Note:** The Qubes application menus for the newly restored Windows qubes "
"will be empty, but can be easily restored via the Qube Manager or by issuing "
"the command ``qubes-sync-appmenus`` in ``dom0``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/windows/qubes-windows-migrate.rst:33
#: ae5d3e13c10545a589e12177ba85031d
msgid "Migration from Qubes R4.2 to R4.3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/windows/qubes-windows-migrate.rst:36
#: a69c1f235a8344eeb3d4d7ab49b9b85b
msgid ""
"As the current new QWT version was developed primarily for Qubes R4.3, it is "
"compatible with this version of Qubes. So, a Windows VM running under Qubes "
"R4.2 can be transferred to R4.3 via backup/restore, without the need to "
"remove and reinstall Qubes Windows Tools. Currently, however, the new Qubes "
"graphics driver is still somewhat buggy and should be used with caution."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/windows/qubes-windows-migrate.rst:38
#: 2f919ed57cdb4fe4803bb97a324ae21c
msgid ""
"Performing an in-place upgrade of Qubes itself from R4.2.4 to R4.3 preserves "
"the functionality of Windows 7, 10, and 11 qubes, including Qubes Windows "
"Tools, so there is no need to perform an upgrade of these qubes. If, for "
"Windows 10 or 11, the Qubes graphics driver was installed, its performance "
"and (current) bugginess may change, however."
msgstr ""
